OL,3,GNEWSABake Off finalist ready for watch
OL,4,Aparty in church
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of this year's remaining
OL,7,Fcontestants on The Great British Bake
OL,8,FOff has spoken of his excitement ahead
OL,9,Fof the finale, for which he will have a
OL,10,Fhuge "watch party" at his church.
OL,12,FMoyin Odeniran, from Loughton in Essex,
OL,13,Fis one of three bakers vying for this
OL,14,Fyear's trophy, along with Tom Whittaker
OL,15,Fand Mo Mahir.
OL,17,FThe 22-year-old said he had watched
OL,18,Fevery episode with friends or fellow
OL,19,Fbakers at home, and had provided tasty
OL,20,Ftreats like treacle tart or vegan
OL,21,Fcookies to fit in with each week's
OL,22,Ftheme.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
